{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Mutmut 3.7.0 probe (2026-08-10): `mutmut run --help` exposes `--max-children`; a clean toy run with `--max-children 1` produced `probe.x_classify__mutmut_{1,2}: killed`; `mutmut show` emitted a unified diff. Installed 3.7.0 source confirms timeout fields/defaults `timeout_constant=1.0`, `timeout_multiplier=15.0`, function AST hashes, module/class/function mutant keys, and statuses killed/survived/no tests/interrupted/not checked/skipped/suspicious/timeout/caught by type check/segfault. `export-cicd-stats` omitted not-checked and caught-by-type-check, confirming the gate must parse `results --all true`. The first probe also caught an invalid `src.*` import layout, supporting the planned real compact-policy smoke."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786421907641163001,"uuid":"819eac50-3a83-46e5-9566-c13c68d26d01"}